    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488740/extras/fce28f6308414200706fe223c6c2b29c.avif?t=1739479663\" width=584 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a friend locally or online with Steam's Remote Play Together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488740/extras/2b449d5ade58ea4d7e366b19a44699a7.webp?t=1739479663\" width=584 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the community to offer feedback, find someone to play with, or whatever! Come party! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Red &amp; Blue</strong></i> is a co-op puzzle-platformer for 2 players. It features various challenges of increasing difficulty that will require great teamwork and complicity! Jump on each other, get chained to each other, help each other solve color-coded puzzles and much more!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488740/extras/fce28f6308414200706fe223c6c2b29c.avif?t=1739479663\" width=584 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a friend locally or online with Steam's Remote Play Together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488740/extras/2b449d5ade58ea4d7e366b19a44699a7.webp?t=1739479663\" width=584 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the community to offer feedback, find someone to play with, or whatever! Come party! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Red &amp; Blue</strong></i> is a co-op puzzle-platformer for 2 players. It features various challenges of increasing difficulty that will require great teamwork and complicity! Jump on each other, get chained to each other, help each other solve color-coded puzzles and much more!</h2>",
